{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/95a23fe85c9c3fdaeeceea9d1995e54f.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=100 /></span>What is Don't Die, Collect Loot? Apart from not dying and collecting loot, it's an arcade roguelite RPG mixed with bullet hells, dedicated to letting you realize the ultimate power fantasy: Become the most powerful being in the world - and then grow even more powerful, with no limits on just how mighty your chosen hero can become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through infinite retro worlds. Collect tons of loot. Sell it. Grow in power. Then grow some more. There is no such thing as overpowered in Don't Die, Collect Loot, there's only stepping stones to greatness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/c34c99836944c3819995a7f9b90abddb.poster.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/c34c99836944c3819995a7f9b90abddb.webm?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/c34c99836944c3819995a7f9b90abddb.mp4?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/34fb30855e84000eefc1c5b24521b7b1.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of five distinct hero classes to lead to ludicrous heights of power and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick out their skills from a tree that's filled with weird, overpowered, or otherwise useful powers to blast through hordes of enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kit out your hero using a random loot generator that can and will create supercharged items (or vendor trash, you never know!), with a rare unique every now and then. All completely customizable to boot!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/b8433aab7706af6d6155cfe5f28b3802.poster.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/b8433aab7706af6d6155cfe5f28b3802.webm?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/b8433aab7706af6d6155cfe5f28b3802.mp4?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight untold numbers of enemies trying to rip your hero apart or drown them in a hail of bullets, across endless, procedurally generated fantasy worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience and make it as challenging or as frictionless as you prefer, even in\u00a0 the middle of a run. There are many ways to realize a proper fantasy power fantasy, after all!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out the mystery of the world! Yes, there is a storyline! Find mysterious artifacts and connect the dots to learn the secrets of this world, frozen in time...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/e2d7f486b8e2efd3a2ee2be312ac8e78.poster.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/e2d7f486b8e2efd3a2ee2be312ac8e78.webm?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/e2d7f486b8e2efd3a2ee2be312ac8e78.mp4?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/741b01193568b145043ac6754bfd07d5a4898a80.jpg"},{"name":"Bombardment..!?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/b1b63b4713e333f585bdc48118fa41164145d27d.jpg"},{"name":"Avarice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/ab1b18d7427633752675da28228251be1637b2ce.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/a3a08a2b12d4afba9102eb8941b88a183e28eec4.jpg"},{"name":"Shopping Spree!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/36b04c8a969c14849e3858580876916446487f5b.jpg"},{"name":"Legitimite Acquisition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/804880c9f690b3a507c26659575a3aaa43179f98.jpg"},{"name":"Smuggler!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/e98dd8b1bfdbf1b4a03efdb39d2f32bc76b37a80.jpg"},{"name":"God Tier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/8de2b73c0081d962611e4dfd0849fecc19f56937.jpg"},{"name":"Unbelievable!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/b0c42f544ebf16e5a810fe5173db903749e9f95f.jpg"},{"name":"Memory Shift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2052160/9b9f9b29171e4e5df1f5f5e8856ab909ab709dee.jpg"}],"total":84},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2052160?t=1771436325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771436325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/79fb9fa48a0edb5da4cb064428971cd4fe78abfd/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1771436325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/79fb9fa48a0edb5da4cb064428971cd4fe78abfd/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1771436325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/029a80cabb7811bb872d847c825814cb.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=1080 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/95a23fe85c9c3fdaeeceea9d1995e54f.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=100 /></span>What is Don't Die, Collect Loot? Apart from not dying and collecting loot, it's an arcade roguelite RPG mixed with bullet hells, dedicated to letting you realize the ultimate power fantasy: Become the most powerful being in the world - and then grow even more powerful, with no limits on just how mighty your chosen hero can become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through infinite retro worlds. Collect tons of loot. Sell it. Grow in power. Then grow some more. There is no such thing as overpowered in Don't Die, Collect Loot, there's only stepping stones to greatness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/c34c99836944c3819995a7f9b90abddb.poster.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/c34c99836944c3819995a7f9b90abddb.webm?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/c34c99836944c3819995a7f9b90abddb.mp4?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/34fb30855e84000eefc1c5b24521b7b1.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of five distinct hero classes to lead to ludicrous heights of power and beyond!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick out their skills from a tree that's filled with weird, overpowered, or otherwise useful powers to blast through hordes of enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kit out your hero using a random loot generator that can and will create supercharged items (or vendor trash, you never know!), with a rare unique every now and then. All completely customizable to boot!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/b8433aab7706af6d6155cfe5f28b3802.poster.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/b8433aab7706af6d6155cfe5f28b3802.webm?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/b8433aab7706af6d6155cfe5f28b3802.mp4?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight untold numbers of enemies trying to rip your hero apart or drown them in a hail of bullets, across endless, procedurally generated fantasy worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience and make it as challenging or as frictionless as you prefer, even in\u00a0 the middle of a run. There are many ways to realize a proper fantasy power fantasy, after all!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out the mystery of the world! Yes, there is a storyline! Find mysterious artifacts and connect the dots to learn the secrets of this world, frozen in time...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/e2d7f486b8e2efd3a2ee2be312ac8e78.poster.avif?t=1771436325\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/e2d7f486b8e2efd3a2ee2be312ac8e78.webm?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052160/extras/e2d7f486b8e2efd3a2ee2be312ac8e78.mp4?t=1771436325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Dan Marchand"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.ak